<title>USA: TABLE - Kentek Information Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Kentek Information Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.28		    $0.26</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.28		     0.38</p>
<p> Net			  1,944		    1,784</p>
<p> Revs			14,224		   18,151</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,047		    6,793</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.68		    $1.24</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.68		     2.42</p>
<p> Net			  4,761		    6,727</p>
<p> Revs			56,460		   74,381</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,022		    5,406</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 net income figures are pro forma to reflect a 40 percent tax rate and the accrual of Excess Liquidation Preference, a cash dividend paid in April 1996 to preferred shareholders.</p>
<p>Full company name is Kentek Information Systems Inc</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
